r:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(projectedDailyNet) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentState.totalCurrency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.005</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    obsoleteItemCount: impact.obsoletedItems.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recommendation: netDailyChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'increase_sinks_or_reduce_faucets'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((经济系统调优))&#10;    预上线校准&#10;      数值模拟&#10;      虚拟玩家代理&#10;      稳态分析&#10;    动态调参&#10;      单次单参&#10;      幅度限制&#10;      可回滚&#10;    通胀治理&#10;      预防性措施&#10;      调节性措施&#10;      紧急性措施&#10;    影响评估&#10;      产出-消耗差分析&#10;      间接影响&#10;      累积影响\">mindmap\n  root((经济系统调优))\n    预上线校准\n      数值模拟\n      虚拟玩家代理\n      稳态分析\n    动态调参\n      单次单参\n      幅度限制\n      可回滚\n    通胀治理\n      预防性措施\n      调节性措施\n      紧急性措施\n    影响评估\n      产出-消耗差分析\n      间接影响\n      累积影响</pre><ul>\n<li>经济调优贯穿游戏全生命周期，从预上线校准到运营期动态调控</li>\n<li>数值模拟通过虚拟玩家代理预测经济运行轨迹，是上线前的必要验证</li>\n<li>动态调参遵循&quot;单次单参、幅度限制、可回滚&quot;三原则，保证调优安全性</li>\n<li>通胀治理从预防到紧急分三级，交易税和消耗活动是最常用的回收手段</li>\n<li>新内容上线前必须进行经济影响评估，关注直接、间接和长期累积三层影响</li>\n<li>经济系统的非线性和滞后性要求设计者具备系统思维和耐心观察的态度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经济系统调优","id":"经济系统调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预上线数值模拟","id":"预上线数值模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"动态调参与热修复","id":"动态调参与热修复"},{"level":2,"text":"通货膨胀治理","id":"通货膨胀治理"},{"level":2,"text":"新内容经济影响评估","id":"新内容经济影响评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商业化模式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/monetization"},"next":{"title":"交互式叙事","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/narrative-design/interactive-storytelling"}}